      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "f9d02fa0-3306-46a7-ae4d-0b268ca7f89a",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Survey: The west\nservice bridge\nbears parcels, not\nmachinery. The",
                "east stair bears a\nhand cart. Heavy\nregulator parts\nmust travel by",
                "depot gate. Nib\nasks whether\ndescribing the\nbridge as intimate\nwould",
                "help. Rivet\nanswers without\nlooking up."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d7a83d63-3531-44f8-a05b-0b1e8f6e45b1",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "c0825982-becf-420a-a291-dc2463756e8f",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The regulator\ncrate weighs six\nunits. The west\nroof bridge holds",
                "three. The east\nstair holds five.\nThe depot gate\nholds eight. The",
                "crate must travel\nintact because its\nspring is secured\ninside a",
                "sealed test frame.\nMoxie cannot split\nit into two trips\nwithout",
                "invalidating the\ntest. The gate\nroute is longer on\nthe drawing but",
                "has no toll,\ntimer, or closed\ndoor."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b1f2010b-d1d6-4ce7-a4e2-3a449acc24ee",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "75840b98-1dca-40f4-a991-f6c3b861f515",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which route did\nthe survey approve\nfor the heavy\nregulator parts?",
                "Choose a route\nthat respects its\nload limits."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3a36a559-2386-4175-aaaf-ce9d9a58fe1d",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
