        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "5ba9addf-2470-4836-ab41-8ae3fd4574ac",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Moxie: I will keep\nthe stop list and\nlog a missed call.\nPip will",
                "answer when I\nreport one. Nobody\ngets to replace\nthe word missed",
                "with almost. The\nroof watch\nvolunteers a dry\nshelf for the log."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dc645eb8-9b4a-42d4-aef8-811f459ad116",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "9595887f-4d37-4a09-a7de-a31697010361",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "After routing the\nintact crate\nthrough the\nsuitable gate, how\nmany",
                "weight units of\ncapacity remain on\nthat crossing? The\nlimits are",
                "maximum loads, not\ntargets that must\nbe filled. Moxie\nwants to know",
                "whether a one-unit\nhand tool bag can\naccompany the\ncrate without",
                "breaking the\nlimit. Count the\ncrate first, then\nfind the remaining",
                "margin."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "190dce72-02ba-4eec-a1ce-44d53bf9710f",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "5b94e555-2b19-4671-a5cf-4d6edf777878",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Pip reads his\nsmaller speech: We\nwill visit these\nstops, record what",
                "fails, and tell\npeople the truth.\nMoxie signs it.\nDot signs as",
                "witness. Nib says\nit lacks sparkle,\nthen asks for a\ncopy to hang in",
                "the lodge."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
